(6832774, 1027110, 91783, '<td valign="top">i would have your lens and camera cleaned asap. you have a ton of dust on them. its probably the sensor, but its really bad. or learn how to edit them out. but in basic you cant. (so clean it...) <br/> <br/>as for the actual photo, i really enjoy the golden light and colors. i''m not sure if centered composition helps or takes away from the photo, but try playing with that! it could make or brake a photo in the future.</td>', 'i would have your lens and camera cleaned asap. you have a ton of dust on them. its probably the sensor, but its really bad. or learn how to edit them out. but in basic you cant. (so clean it...)  as for the actual photo, i really enjoy the golden light and colors. i''m not sure if centered composition helps or takes away from the photo, but try playing with that! it could make or brake a photo in the future.', '2012-08-01 16:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
