(6832836, 1027506, 108580, '<td valign="top">Excellent POV, great focus on the eye, good poise on the bird. Love the outstretched legs and wings flaring for landing. Considering the pigeon is grey, good choice to go b&amp;w and the BG is dark making the primary subject stand out. Only niggle is the bird is starting to turn away from you. An A to this student :) I see you are enjoying the camera and lens combo :)</td>', 'Excellent POV, great focus on the eye, good poise on the bird. Love the outstretched legs and wings flaring for landing. Considering the pigeon is grey, good choice to go b&w and the BG is dark making the primary subject stand out. Only niggle is the bird is starting to turn away from you. An A to this student :) I see you are enjoying the camera and lens combo :)', '2012-08-01 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832837, 1025007, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the tight framing and contrast. Full of life, full of summer...</td>', 'I like the tight framing and contrast. Full of life, full of summer...', '2012-08-01 17:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
