(6832841, 1028240, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the door is... strange. It''s either a distraction or suggestive of a subtext of its own.</td>', 'Nice idea but the door is... strange. It''s either a distraction or suggestive of a subtext of its own.', '2012-08-01 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
