(6833308, 1026904, 67152, '<td valign="top">a beautiful location and beautifully composed.  i almost wonder if the processing pulled back the light in the sky a bit too much...</td>', 'a beautiful location and beautifully composed.  i almost wonder if the processing pulled back the light in the sky a bit too much...', '2012-08-02 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
