(6833325, 1027087, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the arc of the water and how the background seems to follow it''s lead</td>', 'i really like the arc of the water and how the background seems to follow it''s lead', '2012-08-02 08:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833328, 1027138, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a well taken photo, but it seems incredibly random and I don''t quite get what''s going on in the scene itself. It''s incredibly non-sequitur, like there is a subtext that is utterly missing.</td>', 'This is a well taken photo, but it seems incredibly random and I don''t quite get what''s going on in the scene itself. It''s incredibly non-sequitur, like there is a subtext that is utterly missing.', '2012-08-02 08:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833329, 1027541, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice skyline, and the lightning is great, but it takes a backseat to the facade, which visually dominates the photo.</td>', 'Very nice skyline, and the lightning is great, but it takes a backseat to the facade, which visually dominates the photo.', '2012-08-02 08:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833330, 1027535, 93565, '<td valign="top">Nice alignment of elements</td>', 'Nice alignment of elements', '2012-08-02 08:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833331, 1025345, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the flare/washed out scene, but I think if you''re going to use that style, it would work well to have a less visually cluttered scene. Her hair is lit nicely and the detail on her is preserved well, so I''d like to see less of the trees/foliage crowding her out.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the flare/washed out scene, but I think if you''re going to use that style, it would work well to have a less visually cluttered scene. Her hair is lit nicely and the detail on her is preserved well, so I''d like to see less of the trees/foliage crowding her out.', '2012-08-02 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833332, 1025830, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle of capture, and lots of great texture going on here.</td>', 'Very cool angle of capture, and lots of great texture going on here.', '2012-08-02 08:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833333, 1028143, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool shot- very much like a brochure, even if I do deplore cruise ships.</td>', 'Cool shot- very much like a brochure, even if I do deplore cruise ships.', '2012-08-02 08:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833335, 1028240, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see them either be a more prominent element or to have the extra space be more empty. For me, this is a shot of a door or a barn, with a couple thrown in, when in fact, it''s a couple with a barn door that is secondary or happenstance, a mere background. Lighting them selectively either through editing or in situ lights would have accomplished this while still keeping the same sort of a feel.</td>', 'I''d like to see them either be a more prominent element or to have the extra space be more empty. For me, this is a shot of a door or a barn, with a couple thrown in, when in fact, it''s a couple with a barn door that is secondary or happenstance, a mere background. Lighting them selectively either through editing or in situ lights would have accomplished this while still keeping the same sort of a feel.', '2012-08-02 08:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833336, 1027447, 93565, '<td valign="top">Now, I''m not sure if you climb yourself, but I do, and I''m going to firstly say that I know how hard climbing shots are, but you always always want to avoid getting the ass shot, which means you either need to be on the wall itself, at a belay ledge, or elevated and to the side. What happens when you don''t do that is that the steepness and severity of the terrain is greatly lost, you can''t see the climber''s face, and the whole context of the scene is lost.</td>', 'Now, I''m not sure if you climb yourself, but I do, and I''m going to firstly say that I know how hard climbing shots are, but you always always want to avoid getting the ass shot, which means you either need to be on the wall itself, at a belay ledge, or elevated and to the side. What happens when you don''t do that is that the steepness and severity of the terrain is greatly lost, you can''t see the climber''s face, and the whole context of the scene is lost.', '2012-08-02 08:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833337, 1028031, 93565, '<td valign="top">Eyes seem a bit oddly sharp since you applied the vintage faded/soft look to the rest of it. I''d moderate the difference between the two a bit more.</td>', 'Eyes seem a bit oddly sharp since you applied the vintage faded/soft look to the rest of it. I''d moderate the difference between the two a bit more.', '2012-08-02 08:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833339, 1025306, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m waiting for the kids to go sliding out the edge of the frame. The tilt just makes this feel awkward for me.</td>', 'I''m waiting for the kids to go sliding out the edge of the frame. The tilt just makes this feel awkward for me.', '2012-08-02 08:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833340, 1025959, 93565, '<td valign="top">A good scene, but the posing seems very awkwardly synthetic. Bravo on the pets being well behaved but it just feels too contrived.</td>', 'A good scene, but the posing seems very awkwardly synthetic. Bravo on the pets being well behaved but it just feels too contrived.', '2012-08-02 08:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833341, 1026146, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great use of the bridge to frame things.</td>', 'Great use of the bridge to frame things.', '2012-08-02 08:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833342, 1027396, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great sunburst and excellent job capturing detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Great sunburst and excellent job capturing detail in the shadows.', '2012-08-02 08:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833343, 1027446, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of the shot; pleasing abstract.</td>', 'I like the warmth of the shot; pleasing abstract.', '2012-08-02 08:26:55.000000', NULL, 1);
