(6833889, 1028021, 17507, '<td valign="top">Gotta love beat-up, broken-down trucks. Nice color work, too, with the red/green/yellow palette being so strong and clear. Too bad the sky is so flat. Did you try burning it in at all? A Hue/Saturation adjustment layer in PS set to Multiply mode with some masking might have done interesting things.</td>', 'Gotta love beat-up, broken-down trucks. Nice color work, too, with the red/green/yellow palette being so strong and clear. Too bad the sky is so flat. Did you try burning it in at all? A Hue/Saturation adjustment layer in PS set to Multiply mode with some masking might have done interesting things.', '2012-08-02 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6833891, 1027537, 17507, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the composition; nice use of fisheye. But the tonal range looks a little compressed to me. I''d have liked to see darker blacks and lighter whites.</td>', 'I enjoy the composition; nice use of fisheye. But the tonal range looks a little compressed to me. I''d have liked to see darker blacks and lighter whites.', '2012-08-02 22:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
