(6837757, 1027990, 136025, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wizardry</a><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MinsoPhoto</a><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=91783" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ScooterMcNutty</a><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=23484" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bmartuch</a>Thanks guys, I figured it wouldn''t do very well but I really liked the image. Minimalistic was definitely my approach for it!</td>', ' wizardry MinsoPhoto ScooterMcNutty bmartuchThanks guys, I figured it wouldn''t do very well but I really liked the image. Minimalistic was definitely my approach for it!', '2012-08-08 09:38:37.000000', NULL, 0),
