(6837791, 1028231, 138253, '<td valign="top">The shoes make the shot for me.<br/>It''s so often that you''d see a picture like this either cropped part way up or playing up the natural bare foot... the shoes add a fun element to it.<br/>The model seems willing enough to do the shoot (proof is in the picture), but the body language (head turned away and down with eyes looking even further away), shoulders looking tense, arm posture of ''open but not inviting'' and the blue lighting just add together in a way that make this image seem less fun and more work.<br/>A smile in the corner of the mouth, a furtive glance, biting the lower lip or a finger, warmer lighting, or a more vertical/forward posture could have added some ''stay a while'' factor to this image and some points to your score (i think).<br/> <br/>I do think it''s very well done and i''m a bit envious of your having a model willing to do these types of shoots, and if i had voted i''d have likely given it a 7, but with some of the other elements it would''ve been an 8 or 9 easily.</td>', 'The shoes make the shot for me.It''s so often that you''d see a picture like this either cropped part way up or playing up the natural bare foot... the shoes add a fun element to it.The model seems willing enough to do the shoot (proof is in the picture), but the body language (head turned away and down with eyes looking even further away), shoulders looking tense, arm posture of ''open but not inviting'' and the blue lighting just add together in a way that make this image seem less fun and more work.A smile in the corner of the mouth, a furtive glance, biting the lower lip or a finger, warmer lighting, or a more vertical/forward posture could have added some ''stay a while'' factor to this image and some points to your score (i think). I do think it''s very well done and i''m a bit envious of your having a model willing to do these types of shoots, and if i had voted i''d have likely given it a 7, but with some of the other elements it would''ve been an 8 or 9 easily.', '2012-08-08 09:57:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6837798, 1028231, 674, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> 2x1''s, 3x2s 4x3s and 10x4 so 19 ppl who don''t like nudes ouch, <br/> <br/>It''s in focus and exposed ok, the model my ex Gf is pretty enough? <br/> <br/>I do like fighting these up hill battles hehe, back in the day this would have gone down a lot better on dpc when there were more professional photographers and less soccer mums ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>no it wouldn''t !the pose is too awkward and unatural and the cast is off putting! Got nothing to do with it being a nude!</td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: 2x1''s, 3x2s 4x3s and 10x4 so 19 ppl who don''t like nudes ouch,  It''s in focus and exposed ok, the model my ex Gf is pretty enough?  I do like fighting these up hill battles hehe, back in the day this would have gone down a lot better on dpc when there were more professional photographers and less soccer mums ;)  no it wouldn''t !the pose is too awkward and unatural and the cast is off putting! Got nothing to do with it being a nude!', '2012-08-08 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
