(6837949, 1028231, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sulamk:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> 2x1''s, 3x2s 4x3s and 10x4 so 19 ppl who don''t like nudes ouch, <br/> <br/>It''s in focus and exposed ok, the model my ex Gf is pretty enough? <br/> <br/>I do like fighting these up hill battles hehe, back in the day this would have gone down a lot better on dpc when there were more professional photographers and less soccer mums ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>no it wouldn''t !the pose is too awkward and unatural and the cast is off putting! Got nothing to do with it being a nude! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe you should go look at previous free studies from 4-10 years ago a lot more nudes then, hardly see any now. The last nude challenge was 2007 If I recall correctly so you can''t tell me they receive the same voting they did then. <br/> <br/>This scored highly on 500px, I liked the pose as it wasn''t a cliched seen a 1000s times before pose, trying something different. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by sulamk: Originally posted by Giles_uk: 2x1''s, 3x2s 4x3s and 10x4 so 19 ppl who don''t like nudes ouch,  It''s in focus and exposed ok, the model my ex Gf is pretty enough?  I do like fighting these up hill battles hehe, back in the day this would have gone down a lot better on dpc when there were more professional photographers and less soccer mums ;)  no it wouldn''t !the pose is too awkward and unatural and the cast is off putting! Got nothing to do with it being a nude!   Maybe you should go look at previous free studies from 4-10 years ago a lot more nudes then, hardly see any now. The last nude challenge was 2007 If I recall correctly so you can''t tell me they receive the same voting they did then.  This scored highly on 500px, I liked the pose as it wasn''t a cliched seen a 1000s times before pose, trying something different.  ', '2012-08-08 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
