(6838135, 1027152, 108580, '<td valign="top">Now we understand each other''s comments in the FS forum :) You were robbed of a better finish thanks the 44 "below average" 5 or less slaps in the face. <br/>I understood the technicals needed to get this shot, the effort, the skill, lovely pose, pov, upbeat of the wing, catchlight etc. but I felt that it could have been much sharper considering the sunny conditions. At least a 1/2000th would have done that at (ISO 400) or it was possibly too heavily cropped thus losing crispness. I couldn''t comment on it during voting as I was torn between a 6 or 7. So I sat on the fence with a 6 sorry Ray. I gave out 61 votes of 7 to 10 and was fussy due it being a FS.</td>', 'Now we understand each other''s comments in the FS forum :) You were robbed of a better finish thanks the 44 "below average" 5 or less slaps in the face. I understood the technicals needed to get this shot, the effort, the skill, lovely pose, pov, upbeat of the wing, catchlight etc. but I felt that it could have been much sharper considering the sunny conditions. At least a 1/2000th would have done that at (ISO 400) or it was possibly too heavily cropped thus losing crispness. I couldn''t comment on it during voting as I was torn between a 6 or 7. So I sat on the fence with a 6 sorry Ray. I gave out 61 votes of 7 to 10 and was fussy due it being a FS.', '2012-08-08 16:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
