(6838380, 1024726, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MinsoPhoto:</b></div><hr/><i> wow mulch? I actually thought this was a stump. Stumped me :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Here are a couple of other views which make it more obvious what it really is. I was afraid the tiny bit of spiderweb I left in might give it away ... :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1029154" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029154.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029154.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029154.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1029153" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029153.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029153.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/0-4999/1031/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1029153.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by MinsoPhoto: wow mulch? I actually thought this was a stump. Stumped me :)  Here are a couple of other views which make it more obvious what it really is. I was afraid the tiny bit of spiderweb I left in might give it away ... :-)  ', '2012-08-09 00:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
