(6838619, 1028300, 10785, '<td valign="top">Who is being more ignorant here? The guy who gave a criticism based on the published facts or the guy who passes judgement on a person without knowing him?? I happen to believe that using sex to advertise any product or service is unimaginative at best and at worst seeking to capitalize on man''s debauchery. It is low, animalistic and dishonorable toward women. That is my opinion and I am sticking to it. My view of a better society is to love people enough that you will challenge them to aim higher. Try aiming higher!<br/> <br/>Just so you know how open minded I am, I gave your shot a 6.</td>', 'Who is being more ignorant here? The guy who gave a criticism based on the published facts or the guy who passes judgement on a person without knowing him?? I happen to believe that using sex to advertise any product or service is unimaginative at best and at worst seeking to capitalize on man''s debauchery. It is low, animalistic and dishonorable toward women. That is my opinion and I am sticking to it. My view of a better society is to love people enough that you will challenge them to aim higher. Try aiming higher! Just so you know how open minded I am, I gave your shot a 6.', '2012-08-09 15:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
