(7055210, 1026583, 125552, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>I also have a Nikon D7000 and as far as I know (since I''m still learning how to use it) I can only get a 30 second exposure. I was wondering how in the world you can capture these AMAZING photos with a 30-minute exposure!? <br/>Thanks, and by the way you are one of my favorite photographers on this site. :)</td>', 'Hello,I also have a Nikon D7000 and as far as I know (since I''m still learning how to use it) I can only get a 30 second exposure. I was wondering how in the world you can capture these AMAZING photos with a 30-minute exposure!? Thanks, and by the way you are one of my favorite photographers on this site. :)', '2013-06-26 00:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
